    "detailed_description": "My shift was almost over, but I had one more pizza to deliver. Unfortunately, my destination was the creepy manor on the outskirts of town. Little did I know that my night was about to take a turn for the terrifying. This is my true story of deadly traps, knife-wielding cultists, and demonic sacrifices; but how it all ended will shock you the most\u2026<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extras/58b5de63f0cae1f02af209c602b6fcc3.poster.avif?t=1740328514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extras/58b5de63f0cae1f02af209c602b6fcc3.webm?t=1740328514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extras/58b5de63f0cae1f02af209c602b6fcc3.mp4?t=1740328514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extras/dca5b843e3952740136f9c336277f529.webp?t=1740328514\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A terrifyingly true tale<br></li><li> Retro-inspired graphics<br></li><li> Puzzles that test your wits<br></li><li> Talk to NPCs and choose what to say<br></li><li> Multiple endings<br></li><li> Over the top gore!<br></li><li> Full controller support</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extras/1f5fec57af00f7e2b0027bd3decca212.poster.avif?t=1740328514\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extras/1f5fec57af00f7e2b0027bd3decca212.webm?t=1740328514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491500/extra